# DRAFT-multipledispatch-python-require-conan-staging
id: DRAFT-multipledispatch-python-require-conan-staging
title: 纯 Python 包在最小 Conan Python 中的 staging 打包
software: multipledispatch
version: 1.0.0
phase: source|build|package|consumer
category: python-packaging
adaptation_path: B
trigger: target Python 缺少 setuptools.build_meta
observed_error: "BackendUnavailable: Cannot import 'setuptools.build_meta'"
package_type: python-require
runtime_dependencies: []
native_dependencies: []
root_cause: 纯 Python 运行时被误套用 setuptools/pip 构建链，而目标解释器只有最小运行环境
solution: copy source package and egg-info to build-local python-stage, then expose site-packages through PYTHONPATH
staging_path: "{build_folder}/python-stage"
install_path: "lib/python3.12/site-packages"
consumer_contract: PYTHONPATH points to packaged site-packages; cpp_info libraries and include dirs are empty
forbid_1: 在 requirements() 中加入 setuptools 或 pip 作为运行时依赖
forbid_1_reason: 构建工具不是 multipledispatch 的运行时依赖，会污染依赖闭包
forbid_2: 只检查 package_folder 文件存在而不运行导入测试
forbid_2_reason: 错误 PYTHONPATH 仍可能生成看似完整但不可消费的包
verification: conan create source/build/package pass; generated package consumer import and dispatch pass
applicability: pure-python-no-extension-packages
non_applicability: C-extension, Cython, PyO3, platform-library, install-script packages
principles: target-python-minimization, private-staging, real-consumer-import
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-multipledispatch-python-require-conan-staging.md
